cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "deep_cartograph"
abstract: >-
  Deep Cartograph trains and uses machine learning models to compute collective
  variables from molecular dynamics simulations: featurization with PLUMED,
  feature filtering, CV training with mlcolvar, projection and clustering in
  the CV space, and PLUMED inputs for enhanced sampling.
type: software
# Maintained by scripts/bump_version.py — do not edit by hand.
